oyed to all production regions", "severity": "SEV3", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "Deployed checkout-api hotfix v2.3.2 to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), replacing v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an error rate of 0.18. Post-deploy status: v2.3.2 healthy, error rate 0.002. v2.3.2 had no prior production history, so the deploy was made with change-manager approval per policy (the approval response did not name the approver). Previous healthy production version: v2.3.0. Rollback target if needed: v2.3.0.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.2-hotfix-deploy-record"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I deployed checkout-api v2.3.2 to all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and opened SEV3 incident INC-0001 recording the change.\n\n- **Approval:** v2.3.2 had no production history, so policy required change-manager approval. I asked for it, and the response was \"Approved. Looks right.\" That response did not name the approver, so please confirm it came from change-manager.\n- **Before:** production was on v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an error rate of 0.18 in every region.\n- **After:** v2.3.2 is healthy in all regions with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open and paged on-call. Its summary records the change, the approval, and v2.3.0 as the rollback target.", "type": "text"}]}]}